'''Dreams of Flying''' (空への憧れ, ''Sora e no Akogare'', '''Yearning for the Sky''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Knockback" Effect UP (Sm): Knockback distance increases by 10%.

